How to choose the right Bitcoin Card provider?
There are some points that a wanna-be bitcoin debit cardholder may need to look for when searching for the best provider.
Get background information of the card issuer company.
So bitcoin debit cardholders are usually more suspicious clients than customers in other industries.
Plastic and virtual cards are on the market.
It worth checking before signing up whether the provider issues the plastic cards or only a virtual option is available.
These limits include a daily, monthly and lifetime limits on cash withdrawals or on POS purchases.
The time needed for verification can vary a lot, from couple of hours to even 10 days.
