There remain, however, some significant obstacles to the widespread adoption of AM in the O&G industry.
What’s more, a print file set up on one AM machine can’t be used on another one – sometimes even if they are the same make and model – without user intervention; the result can be an ever-changing file based on individual machine calibration. This creates a digital inventory challenge similar to the current physical inventory one that O&G operators are already dealing with.
